{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "de42a859e3e7c58d32d9a6c4b69979b14dc27c52770951f761935ff3dff3b3b7", "ja": "{$P$}！　この間のプール、すっごく\n盛り上がったよね！　みんな喜んでくれたでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}！之前在游泳池的时候，\n气氛超热烈的呢！大家也都很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1001_p", "source_sha256": "60810be7972bfa2fa6d98c184373f6aa988ea0a4ed385a5c3c8237d51f3c7df5", "ja": "そうだな。あれから海美のファンになって、\n劇場に来てくれた人もいるみたいだ。", "zh": "是啊。那之后似乎也有人成为海美的粉丝，\n还特地来剧场看表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "f7340220a48dfddd1b4a313e259cbe244c720b31e1318bddf518410ec69f93d8", "ja": "ホントにっ！？　やったね☆\nそれじゃ、もっともっと頑張らないと！", "zh": "真的吗！？好耶☆\n那我得比现在更加、更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "69970bb7b99f8c97ee5c4c98e19a727cd032725f13a92a499fef511df6de4a44", "ja": "自転車とプールはやったから……次は、空かな！？\nよしっ、とりあえず屋上行ってくる！", "zh": "脚踏车和游泳池已经试过了……下次要朝天空发展吗！？\n好，总之我先去一下屋顶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ace9194d29ddca680a9049d04163c6135a147f0abb96f6610a788707f19d07ec", "ja": "待て、海美！　空は危ない気がする！　そうだ、\nボルダリングは？　海美はボルダリングが趣味だろ？", "zh": "等等，海美！天空感觉很危险！\n对了，攀岩怎么样？海美的兴趣是攀岩对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab5e164cd17170630675ab4779e156fe7df22d303d600eece1cd0e21fc1e3028", "ja": "さっすが{$P$}！　そうそう、\nこの劇場の壁、前からすごく登りたかったんだよねー！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}！没错没错，\n我从之前就很想爬爬看这座剧场的墙壁了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "ad4df40c33c0f618f957141771297bc1237b0e0828fc4271eeb6fac1fe507bd2", "ja": "それじゃ私、ちょっと登ってくるね！", "zh": "那我就去爬一下啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0032_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ac5c157ca66f1cd3421a93d8331e61d924ead948156db2c39cebfed6a74f1989", "ja": "いや、劇場の壁って……待つんだ、海美ー！", "zh": "呃，你说剧场的墙壁……等等啊，海美──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
